GNU Midnight Commander is a user-friendly yet powerful file manager
and visual shell, useful to novice and guru alike. It provides a
clear, user-friendly, and somewhat protected interface to a Unix
system while making many frequent file operations more efficient and
preserving the full power of the command prompt. You will wonder how
you could ever live without it.

The mc of azsupport/ports (misc/mc/files/mc.conf): the editor, the
subshell, the charsets and SFTP, on the shared GLib of the package glib and
libssh2 of az; zip, 7z, rar and ISO images open with tar of the base
system; fixes of mc after 4.8.33 (misc/mc/files/*.patch). Versions,
options and patches: share/doc/mc/VERSIONS.
